BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d1-keynote1@ntndays.space
DTSTAMP:20260923T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261013T091500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261013T100000
SUMMARY:Keynote: Hassan Fawaz (Univity) - From Vision to Validation
DESCRIPTION:From Vision to Validation\, Univity's 5G NTN Journey.\n\nThis
  keynote will introduce Univity's vision for 5G Non-Terrestrial Networks
  and present some of the key building blocks developed to turn that visi
 on into a validated system. Through uniSpark\, uniShape and the company'
 s digital-twin environment\, the presentation will highlight how archite
 cture\, emulation and end-to-end testing are used to progressively desig
 n\, integrate and de-risk satellite-based 5G connectivity.
LOCATION:Amphitheatre Jean-Baptiste Say (access Y\, lower level)\, Cnam\,
  292 Rue Saint-Martin\, 75003 Paris\, France
URL:https://ntndays.space/#program
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
